		*!*									ENDIF
		*!*								ENDIF
		*!*							ENDIF
						ENDCASE
					ENDIF
					****
					
					IF nMess = 6	&&Correct record
						IF ThisForm.lClone
							ThisForm.txtReceivingID.Value = ''
							*ThisForm.txtID_Master.Value	= 0
							*ThisForm.txtID_Detail.Value	= 0
							*ThisForm.txtTBL.Value		= ''
